{"id": "46922", "title": "艺伎回忆录", "author": "［美］阿瑟·高顿", "category": "文学名著", "count": 35, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/46/46922/46922s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/46/46922.htm", "intro": "从渔家孤女千代到京都名艺伎小百合，她的命运，如同漂浮在潺潺流水上的片片落花，永远无法预知未来的方向。优雅而精致的艺馆是富人声色犬马的天堂，却也是小百合每天要直面风刀霜剑的地方。将军、男爵、会长、医生……男人们或贪婪或深邃的目光，织成了一张她赖以生存又难以挣脱的网。", "base": "files/article/html/46/46922", "chapters": [{"title": "正文一", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "6369798.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "6369799.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "6369800.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "6369801.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "6369802.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "6369803.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "6369804.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "6369805.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "6369806.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "6369807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "6369808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "6369809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文二", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "6369811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "6369812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "6369813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "6369814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "6369815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "6369816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "6369817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "6369818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "6369819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "6369820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "6369821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "6369822.html", "available": false}, {"title":